-- The ordinal update is generated bookkeeping. Under `$fast_math` its checked I32 increment
-- traps instead of returning through the function's Error! slot, even though the loop authors no
-- step and the addition keeps ordinary semantics. `$safe_math` must still reject the boundary.
$fast_math $safe_math
ordinal_walk |start I64, finish I64| -> I64, Error!:
    loop start to finish |value, ordinal|:
    ;
    return start
;
